onok lekerek\u00edt\u00e9se"],"Customize Layout":["Elrendez\u00e9s testreszab\u00e1sa"],"Show the small Powered by TranslatePress label in the language switcher.":["A kis \u201ePowered by TranslatePress\u201d felirat megjelen\u00edt\u00e9se a nyelvv\u00e1lt\u00f3ban."],"You have unsaved changes. Leave anyway?":["Nem mentett v\u00e1ltoztat\u00e1said vannak. Elhagyod az oldalt?"],"Switcher animations":["Nyelvv\u00e1lt\u00f3 anim\u00e1ci\u00f3k"],"Transforms the language switcher into a button showing the other available language, not the current one. <br> Only works when there are exactly two languages, the default one and a translation one.":["A nyelvv\u00e1lt\u00f3 gombb\u00e1 alak\u00edt\u00e1sa, amely a m\u00e1sik el\u00e9rhet\u0151 nyelvet mutatja, nem az aktu\u00e1lisat. <br> Csak akkor m\u0171k\u00f6dik, ha pontosan k\u00e9t nyelv van: az alap\u00e9rtelmezett \u00e9s egy ford\u00edt\u00e1s."],"This option only works when exactly two languages are published.":["Ez a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s csak akkor m\u0171k\u00f6dik, ha pontosan k\u00e9t nyelv van k\u00f6zz\u00e9t\u00e9ve."],"Copied!":["M\u00e1solva!"],"Copy":["M\u00e1sol\u00e1s"],"Use shortcode on any page or widget. You can also add the Language Switcher Block in the WP Gutenberg Editor.":["Haszn\u00e1lja a shortcode-ot b\u00e1rmely oldalon vagy widgetben. A WP Gutenberg szerkeszt\u0151ben is hozz\u00e1adhatja a Nyelvv\u00e1lt\u00f3 blokkot."],"Shortcode":["Shortcode"],"Additional Settings":["Tov\u00e1bbi be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok"],"Open the language switcher shortcode by clicking on it instead of hovering. <br> Close it by clicking on it, anywhere else on the screen or by pressing the escape key. <br> This will affect only the shortcode language switcher.":["A nyelvv\u00e1lt\u00f3 shortcode megnyit\u00e1sa kattint\u00e1ssal, az eg\u00e9rmutat\u00f3 f\u00f6l\u00e9 h\u00faz\u00e1sa helyett. <br> Bez\u00e1r\u00e1sa kattint\u00e1ssal, a k\u00e9perny\u0151 b\u00e1rmely m\u00e1s pontj\u00e1ra kattintva vagy az Escape billenty\u0171 megnyom\u00e1s\u00e1val. <br> Ez csak a nyelvv\u00e1lt\u00f3 shortcode-ot \u00e9rinti."],"Menu Switcher Layout":["Men\u00fc nyelvv\u00e1lt\u00f3 elrendez\u00e9se"],"Go to <a href=\"\/wp-admin\/nav-menus.php\">Appearance \u2192 Menus<\/a> to add languages to the Language Switcher in any menu.<br> <a href=\"https:\/\/translatepress.com\/docs\/settings\/language-switcher\/?utm_source=tp-language-switcher&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=ls-menu-item#menu-switcher\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more in our documentation.<\/a>":["Ugorjon a <a href=\"\/wp-admin\/nav-menus.php\">Megjelen\u00e9s \u2192 Men\u00fck<\/a> men\u00fcpontra, hogy nyelveket adjon hozz\u00e1 a Nyelvv\u00e1lt\u00f3hoz b\u00e1rmely men\u00fcben.<br> <a href=\"https:\/\/translatepress.com\/docs\/settings\/language-switcher\/?utm_source=tp-language-switcher&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=ls-menu-item#menu-switcher\" target=\"_blank\">Tudjon meg t\u00f6bbet a dokument\u00e1ci\u00f3nkban.<\/a>"]}}}